# Boscali Summer, prologue: The Tassara Job.
# Meridian Freight & Aviation Services, a half-legal contractor, is hired by the Tassara Ministry to stop an unmarked cargo flight leaving Camp Tifa. The escorts
# fire first, the cargo plane is forced down near the border range, and two hours later the player flies a helicopter with the ground team to the wreck.
# The crew's cargo is PALA weapons for the coup in the Boscali Republic: the hook into chapter 1, Twelve Miles Out.
# Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-19-prologue-tassara-job-design.md. Voice lines: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-19-prologue-voice-manifest.tsv.
# Generated from a template (voice file ids numbered per cast, vehicle heights read from the map); edit this file directly from now on.
# The company name is only written in the cast roles and the briefing: search for Meridian to rename it.

scenario prologue-tassara-job
title "Prologue: The Tassara Job"
base "Tassara - Fuzzball"
group "Boscali Summer"
campaign boscali-summer 0
# This is the Fuzzball map but not the mode: the description marker is replaced by the script's own. Everything that could start a fight of its own is off.
without events theater-ops air-survival strategic-command dynamic-operations support high-command squad progression kaiju spooktober urban-combat trenches nation

about
| Tassara, a sand sea with three airstrips and a rock range down the border. The army cannot be seen stopping an unmarked cargo flight that left the
| smugglers' strip at Camp Tifa at dawn, so the Ministry has hired somebody who does not officially exist: Meridian Freight & Aviation Services,
| cargo on the books, security consulting off them.
|
| You fly for Meridian as RONIN. Identify the cargo aircraft, shadow it, and do not fire first. Make it turn back or put it down. Two hours later,
| be in a helicopter over the crash site with a ground team, before the smugglers' trucks arrive.
|
| Your replies in the radio net are your own. The firm's boss, Mr. Ledger, keeps count.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ the world
time 11
weather 0.1
ending 15
gamemusic off
# The regular sides stay out of it: the pilot is enlisted into the firm by the story.
lock bdf
lock pala
peace pmc bdf pala
peace pirates bdf pala

# Meridian's flight, in the air south of Fort Tassara with the player. Pickle is young and gets in the way of things.
unit deacon       new aircraft CAS1 side=pmc at -1800 2300 8300 heading=215 speed=200 skill=0.9 loadout=gun_ammo_35mm_720+gun_30mm_rotary_pod++gunpod_20mm+Rocket2_4Podx3++AAM3_double+AGM1_double
unit pickle       new aircraft CAS1 side=pmc at -2250 2330 8200 heading=215 speed=200 skill=0.35 loadout=gun_ammo_35mm_720+gun_30mm_rotary_pod++gunpod_20mm+Rocket2_4Podx3++AAM3_double+AGM1_double
unit widow        new aircraft CAS1 side=pmc at -1600 2300 8700 heading=215 speed=200 skill=0.8 loadout=gun_ammo_35mm_720+gun_30mm_rotary_pod++gunpod_20mm+Rocket2_4Podx3++AAM3_double+AGM1_double

# The smugglers' cargo flight: a VL-49 and four light fighters, out of Camp Tifa and bound east for the border range.
unit hauler_plane new aircraft QuadVTOL1 side=pirates at -9500 1700 -2800 heading=75 speed=110 skill=0.6
unit esc_1        new aircraft SmallFighter1 side=pirates at -9000 1800 -2300 heading=75 speed=150 skill=0.45 loadout=gun_20mm_internal_500+AAM2_single_internal+AAM2_single_internal+AShM2_double+AAM1_single
unit esc_2        new aircraft SmallFighter1 side=pirates at -9000 1800 -3300 heading=75 speed=150 skill=0.4 loadout=gun_20mm_internal_500+AAM2_single_internal+AAM2_single_internal+AShM2_double+AAM1_single
unit esc_3        new aircraft SmallFighter1 side=pirates at -10200 1900 -2000 heading=75 speed=150 skill=0.4 loadout=gun_20mm_internal_500+AAM2_single_internal+AAM2_single_internal+AShM2_double+AAM1_single
unit esc_4        new aircraft SmallFighter1 side=pirates at -10200 1900 -3600 heading=75 speed=150 skill=0.4 loadout=gun_20mm_internal_500+AAM2_single_internal+AAM2_single_internal+AShM2_double+AAM1_single

# The crash site (the LZ) is a flat pan at -500, -3500, west of the range. Meridian's ground team arrives when the helicopter sets down.
unit gravel_1     new vehicle Truck2-MRAP side=pmc at -380 438.7 -3560 heading=270 skill=0.8
unit gravel_2     new vehicle Truck2-MRAP side=pmc at -330 439.7 -3420 heading=270 skill=0.8
unit gravel_3     new vehicle LCV45 side=pmc at -440 441.5 -3350 heading=270 skill=0.8

# The smugglers' recovery party: technicals from the west, then a gunship that was not on the manifest, then trucks and a gun that points up.
unit tech_1       new vehicle LCV45 side=pirates at -3000 390.3 -3900 heading=90 skill=0.5 to=-600,-3550
unit tech_2       new vehicle LCV45 side=pirates at -3100 383.4 -3300 heading=90 skill=0.5 to=-600,-3400
unit tech_3       new vehicle Truck2-MRAP side=pirates at -3300 390.5 -3650 heading=90 skill=0.5 to=-650,-3500
unit gunship      new aircraft AttackHelo1 side=pirates at -4300 640 -2200 heading=100 speed=50 skill=0.6 loadout=turret_30mmHE_750+AGM1_quad_internal+RocketPod1_triple+IRMS1_double+IRMS1_double
unit mrap_1       new vehicle Truck2-MRAP side=pirates at -600 412.8 -6300 heading=0 skill=0.5 to=-500,-3700
unit mrap_2       new vehicle Truck2-MRAP side=pirates at -300 418.1 -6500 heading=0 skill=0.5 to=-400,-3700
unit aa_1         new vehicle SPAAG1 side=pirates at -1500 393.8 -5800 heading=20 skill=0.6 to=-300,-4300

# Staging.
objective stage_wing wait 8
  then spawn deacon pickle widow
objective stage_convoy wait 2
  then spawn hauler_plane esc_1 esc_2 esc_3 esc_4

# Part 1: the cargo flight.
objective find_cargo pmc "Find the cargo flight" reach -9500 1800 -2800 range=5000
  then start roe escorts force_down cargo_escaped shots_clock
objective roe pmc "Shadow and identify. Do not fire first." wait 3000
objective escorts pmc "Destroy the escorts" destroy esc_1 esc_2 esc_3 esc_4
objective force_down pmc "Force the cargo aircraft down" destroy hauler_plane
  then stop cargo_escaped
# The escorts open fire by themselves; if nobody has been hit by this time the story says they did.
objective shots_clock wait 40
# Lose: the cargo crosses the range and the buyer takes delivery.
objective cargo_escaped pirates wait 600
  then victory 8

# Part 2: the crash site, two hours later.
objective lz pmc "Fly low to the crash site" reach -500 480 -3500 range=400
objective team_drop wait 2
  then spawn gravel_1 gravel_2 gravel_3
  then start hold_lz wave_1 wave_2 wave_3 team_lost
objective wave_1 wait 20
  then spawn tech_1 tech_2 tech_3
  then start techs
objective wave_2 wait 60
  then spawn gunship
  then start gunship_wave
objective wave_3 wait 105
  then spawn mrap_1 mrap_2 aa_1
objective techs pmc "Hold off the technicals" destroy tech_1 tech_2 tech_3
objective gunship_wave pmc "Stop the gunship" destroy gunship
objective hold_lz pmc "Hold the site" wait 150
  then start interrogate
# Lose: the ground team is cut down.
objective team_lost pirates destroy gravel_1 gravel_2 gravel_3 need=60%
  then victory 8
objective interrogate pmc "Question the crew" wait 3000
# The end: the story completes this after the last line; the clock is a fallback.
objective north pmc "Head north to Ignus" wait 3000
  then victory 15

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ the story
cast ronin     wing    "RONIN"        "Meridian flight lead"
cast widow     wing    "WIDOW"        "Meridian, weapons officer"
cast deacon    wing    "DEACON"       "Meridian, wing"
cast pickle    wing    "PICKLE"       "Meridian, wing"
cast speedbump wing    "SPEEDBUMP"    "Meridian, helicopter pilot"
cast gravel    wing    "GRAVEL"       "Meridian ground team"
cast sentry    awacs   "SENTRY"       "Ministry air control, on loan"
cast ops       command "MERIDIAN OPS" "Meridian dispatch"
cast ledger    command "LEDGER"       "Managing director, Meridian"
cast kestrel   enemy   "KESTREL"      "Escort lead"
cast hauler    enemy   "HAULER"       "Cargo pilot"

beat intro when start
  card "PROLOGUE" "The Tassara Job" seconds=5
  dip
  enlist pmc
  seat "A-19 Brawler" at -2000 2300 8500 heading=215 speed=200

# Radio check, tasking, the rules. Short turns, people step on each other, the boss leaks one memory and moves on.
beat brief when join
  # The flight is staged after the join (it was staged at mission start, before the pilot joined the firm's side).
  start stage_wing
  orders deacon follow player
  orders widow follow player
  orders pickle follow player
  say ops "Meridian flight, Ops. Channel's recorded. Check in, in order." voice=pro-ops-01.mp3
  say deacon "Deacon, up." voice=pro-deacon-01.mp3
  say widow "Widow, up." voice=pro-widow-01.mp3
  say pickle "Pickle, up! Uh, three. Pickle three, up. Sorry." voice=pro-pickle-01.mp3
  say deacon "Pickle. Just up." voice=pro-deacon-02.mp3
  say ops "Ronin, you're on the board. Camp Tifa departure, oh six forty. One heavy, four escorts. Eastbound." voice=pro-ops-02.mp3
  hint "Find the cargo flight, south-west of you"
  say widow "Escorts armed?" voice=pro-widow-02.mp3
  say ops "Assume so." voice=pro-ops-03.mp3
  say ledger "Morning. The army can't be seen stopping that flight. We can." voice=pro-ledger-01.mp3
  say ledger "Flat fee. Bonus if the cargo comes back intact. Airframes we lose come off the top." voice=pro-ledger-02.mp3
  say pickle "Intact like whole, or intact like landed? Because those are two, those are--" voice=pro-pickle-02.mp3
  say deacon "Pickle." voice=pro-deacon-03.mp3
  say ledger "Rules. Identify. Shadow. Turn them--" voice=pro-ledger-03.mp3
  say sentry "Meridian flight, Sentry. One heavy, four fast, no squawk. Two one zero, fourteen kilometres." voice=pro-sentry-01.mp3
  say ledger "Turn them back, or put them down." voice=pro-ledger-04.mp3
  say deacon "Copy." voice=pro-deacon-04.mp3
  say ledger "Nobody fires first. I signed for a first shot once." voice=pro-ledger-05.mp3
  reply roe "LEDGER: nobody fires first." paragon="Copy. We look, we don't touch." renegade="And if they shoot first?" paragon_voice=pro-ronin-01.mp3 renegade_voice=pro-ronin-02.mp3 timeout=15

beat roe-p when flag roe-paragon
  say ledger "Good. That costs nothing." voice=pro-ledger-06.mp3
  flag roe-done

beat roe-r when flag roe-renegade
  say ledger "Then there's a clause. Self-defence is billable. A dead pilot is not." voice=pro-ledger-07.mp3
  flag roe-done

beat approach when flag roe-done
  start stage_convoy find_cargo
  orders esc_1 follow hauler_plane
  orders esc_2 follow hauler_plane
  orders esc_3 follow hauler_plane
  orders esc_4 follow hauler_plane
  say sentry "Ronin, Sentry. Convoy's twelve kilometres ahead. Stay high. Stay boring." voice=pro-sentry-02.mp3
  hint "Find the cargo flight" seconds=12

beat found when done find_cargo
  music "synthetic-warfront.mp3" volume=0.3 loop
  say pickle "Tally! Tally five, they're just, they're flying. Straight and level. Is that normal?" voice=pro-pickle-03.mp3
  say deacon "They're not hiding. They're not worried." voice=pro-deacon-05.mp3
  say widow "Widow. Four escorts, two missiles each. Transport's unarmed. Probably." voice=pro-widow-03.mp3
  say kestrel "Unidentified flight, escort lead. Restricted airspace. Turn away. I ask once." voice=pro-kestrel-01.mp3
  say ops "Flight, Ops. Registration check. Transport belongs to a company in a free port. That company belongs to a company in another free port." voice=pro-ops-04.mp3
  hint "Shadow the cargo aircraft. Do not fire first" seconds=15

beat src-hit when damaged pickle 90
  flag fire-open

beat src-clock when done shots_clock
  flag fire-open

beat shots when flag fire-open
  say kestrel "Escorts. Weapons free." voice=pro-kestrel-02.mp3
  say pickle "Tone! Ronin, I've got tone, I've got a--" voice=pro-pickle-04.mp3
  say widow "Missile launch. Theirs. Ronin." voice=pro-widow-04.mp3
  complete roe
  hint "Destroy the escorts" seconds=15
  reply fire "PICKLE has a missile on him. Your call." paragon="Pickle, flares, break right. Deacon, stay with him." renegade="Pickle, don't break. Kill him first." paragon_voice=pro-ronin-03.mp3 renegade_voice=pro-ronin-04.mp3 timeout=10

beat fire-p when flag fire-paragon
  say deacon "Covering. Pickle, flares. Now." voice=pro-deacon-06.mp3
  say pickle "Flares! Flares going. Oh God. Okay, okay, okay--" voice=pro-pickle-05.mp3

beat fire-r when flag fire-renegade
  say deacon "Copy. Pickle. You heard him." voice=pro-deacon-07.mp3
  say pickle "Staying! I'm staying, he's still on me, Ronin, he's, I can't--" voice=pro-pickle-06.mp3

# The big one: fear first, then the shaky part. Nobody jokes here.
beat pickle-down when destroyed pickle
  flag pickle-down
  say pickle "I'm hit! Ronin, I'm hit, it's on fire, the stick's, the stick's--" voice=pro-pickle-07.mp3
  say deacon "Pickle. Eject." voice=pro-deacon-08.mp3
  say pickle "I can't, Deacon, I can't, my hands--" voice=pro-pickle-08.mp3
  say deacon "Eject. Now." voice=pro-deacon-09.mp3
  say pickle "Ejecting, ejecting, eje--" voice=pro-pickle-09.mp3
  say widow "Chute. I have one chute." voice=pro-widow-05.mp3
  say deacon "Copy that. God." voice=pro-deacon-10.mp3
  say pickle "Ronin? I'm alive. I'm okay. Am I okay? I think I'm okay." voice=pro-pickle-10.mp3
  say pickle "My legs work. They work. Okay. Okay." voice=pro-pickle-11.mp3
  say ledger "Ops, put the ground team on that pilot. Replacement is fourteen months." voice=pro-ledger-08.mp3
  say ops "Ground team tasked." voice=pro-ops-05.mp3
  hint "Pickle ejected: the ground team will pick him up" seconds=10

beat kestrel-down when destroyed esc_1
  say kestrel "That's not possible." voice=pro-kestrel-03.mp3
  say kestrel "I'm hit! Cargo, go, go, make the range--" voice=pro-kestrel-04.mp3
  say hauler "Kestrel? Kestrel, say again! They said boxes. Only boxes." voice=pro-hauler-01.mp3

beat splash-2 when destroyed esc_2
  say deacon "Splash one." voice=pro-deacon-11.mp3

beat splash-3 when destroyed esc_3
  say widow "Another down." voice=pro-widow-06.mp3

beat src-cargo when done force_down
  flag cargo-grounded

beat escorts-down when done escorts unless=cargo-grounded
  say sentry "Sentry. Escorts are gone. Cargo's turning for the range. I lose him in the passes." voice=pro-sentry-03.mp3
  say ledger "The bonus is forty percent of the fee. It's on that airframe." voice=pro-ledger-09.mp3
  reply cargo "HAULER is running for the range." paragon="Hauler, Ronin. Put it on the ground. Nobody else has to die." renegade="Widow. His engine." paragon_voice=pro-ronin-05.mp3 renegade_voice=pro-ronin-06.mp3 timeout=12

beat cargo-p when flag cargo-paragon
  say hauler "If I land, they'll... no. Okay. Okay. The flats, south of the range. Don't shoot." voice=pro-hauler-02.mp3

beat cargo-r when flag cargo-renegade
  say widow "Tracking. Fox two." voice=pro-widow-07.mp3
  say hauler "Engine! I'm hit, I've lost the engine, putting her down, don't shoot, don't shoot--" voice=pro-hauler-03.mp3
  say ledger "The engine was a third of the bonus. Noted." voice=pro-ledger-10.mp3

beat cargo-down when done force_down
  flag cargo-grounded
  say sentry "Cargo's down on the flats. Wheels up. Three out of the aircraft." voice=pro-sentry-04.mp3
  say deacon "Full flaps. Flat flare. That's a freight pilot." voice=pro-deacon-12.mp3
  say ops "Recovery party moving from the west. Trucks. One gunship, not declared. Two hours out." voice=pro-ops-06.mp3
  say ledger "Back to the strip. Fuel, rearm, the helicopter. We take that site first." voice=pro-ledger-11.mp3
  music stop
  flag part1-done

# The time-skip: the pilot's aircraft is removed, the helicopter handed over, with a prerendered shot in between.
beat skip when flag part1-done
  card "TWO HOURS LATER" "Forward strip, Tassara border" seconds=5
  dip
  leave
  video "pro-heli.mp4"
  clock 13.5
  seat "UH-90 Ibis" at -3000 760 4500 heading=190 speed=45
  flag in-heli

beat heli-brief when flag in-heli
  say speedbump "Seven-One, Speedbump. I've got the checklist, you've got the stick. Rotors are turning. That's good. That's good, right?" voice=pro-speedbump-01.mp3
  say widow "Widow, right seat. Radios and gun are mine. Speedbump. Breathe." voice=pro-widow-08.mp3
  say gravel "Gravel. Four aboard. West side of the wreck, inside the berm." voice=pro-gravel-01.mp3
  say sentry "Seven-One, Sentry. Trucks on the old road, ten minutes back. Rotary contact, nine seconds. Then nothing." voice=pro-sentry-05.mp3
  say ledger "Every hour someone else holds that crew, they're worth less. Low and fast." voice=pro-ledger-12.mp3
  hint "Fly low to the crash site" seconds=15
  start lz
  say speedbump "Ronin, soft or fast? On the ground, I mean. I've only done soft. On a pad. With a flag on it." voice=pro-speedbump-02.mp3
  reply heli "SPEEDBUMP: soft or fast, Ronin?" paragon="Soft. We've got time." renegade="Fast. Hard if you have to." paragon_voice=pro-ronin-07.mp3 renegade_voice=pro-ronin-08.mp3 timeout=12

beat heli-p when flag heli-paragon
  say speedbump "Soft. Okay. Slow and smooth. I can do that. I did it once. In training. Mostly." voice=pro-speedbump-03.mp3
  say widow "He's fine. Speedbump, eyes outside." voice=pro-widow-09.mp3

beat heli-r when flag heli-renegade
  say speedbump "Fast. Right. Fast and hard. Hard's sort of my thing. Ask the landing gear." voice=pro-speedbump-04.mp3
  say gravel "Hard's fine." voice=pro-gravel-02.mp3

beat lz-reached when done lz
  flag lz-reached
  say speedbump "That's the wreck. It's bigger. Up close, it's a lot bigger. Flat patch by the tail. There. There." voice=pro-speedbump-05.mp3
  say gravel "LZ's cold. Put us down." voice=pro-gravel-03.mp3
  hint "Land at the crash site" seconds=20
  countdown 45 "LAND AT THE LZ" flag=lz-timeout

beat touchdown when landed if=lz-reached unless=team-dropped
  flag team-dropped
  countdown stop
  say gravel "Out. Wreck's ours. Ronin, watch the road." voice=pro-gravel-04.mp3
  start team_drop

beat lz-late when flag lz-timeout unless=team-dropped
  flag team-dropped
  say speedbump "I'm not landing in that! I'm hovering, I'm hovering, Gravel, go, go!" voice=pro-speedbump-06.mp3
  say gravel "Ropes. Go." voice=pro-gravel-05.mp3
  start team_drop

beat pickle-found when flag team-dropped if=pickle-down
  say gravel "Got your wingman. Truck two. Sunburn, nothing else." voice=pro-gravel-06.mp3
  say pickle "Ronin? It's Pickle. I'm okay. They gave me water. I lost a boot. Sorry about the airplane." voice=pro-pickle-12.mp3
  say ledger "Stay with the medic, Pickle." voice=pro-ledger-13.mp3

beat wave1 when done wave_1
  say sentry "Technicals, three, from the west. Fast." voice=pro-sentry-06.mp3
  say gravel "Contact west. Speedbump." voice=pro-gravel-07.mp3
  say speedbump "On it! I'm on it. Widow, that's three, that's three, right?" voice=pro-speedbump-07.mp3
  say widow "Three. Left of the road. Engaging." voice=pro-widow-10.mp3
  hint "Destroy the technicals" seconds=12

beat techs-down when done techs
  say gravel "West is clear." voice=pro-gravel-08.mp3

beat wave2 when done wave_2
  say sentry "Gunship. West, nine kilometres, low. Closing." voice=pro-sentry-07.mp3
  say speedbump "That's us. We're the cover. That's us." voice=pro-speedbump-08.mp3
  say widow "Launch! Flares. Ronin, break, break!" voice=pro-widow-11.mp3
  say speedbump "Oh no." voice=pro-speedbump-09.mp3
  hint "Stop the gunship" seconds=12

beat gun-down when done gunship_wave
  say widow "Gunship's down." voice=pro-widow-12.mp3
  say speedbump "We got him. We, okay. We got him." voice=pro-speedbump-10.mp3
  say gravel "Back to work." voice=pro-gravel-09.mp3

beat wave3 when done wave_3
  say sentry "More trucks from the south. And a gun that points up. Gravel, two minutes." voice=pro-sentry-08.mp3
  say gravel "Copy. Ronin, stay up." voice=pro-gravel-10.mp3

# The interrogation: the same facts either way, a different temperature.
beat interrogate when done hold_lz
  say gravel "Site's ours. Crew's alive. Pilot, loadmaster, a kid. Nobody's hurt." voice=pro-gravel-11.mp3
  say hauler "I don't know what's in the crates. I don't. I fly, they pay me. I have a daughter." voice=pro-hauler-04.mp3
  say gravel "Crates say PALA." voice=pro-gravel-12.mp3
  say hauler "...I can read." voice=pro-hauler-05.mp3
  say gravel "Ronin. He's stalling. How do you want it?" voice=pro-gravel-13.mp3
  reply grill "GRAVEL: the pilot is stalling." paragon="Sit him down. Water. Let him talk." renegade="Do what you have to. We're short on time." paragon_voice=pro-ronin-09.mp3 renegade_voice=pro-ronin-10.mp3 timeout=15

beat grill-p when flag grill-paragon
  say gravel "Water. Blanket. Medic." voice=pro-gravel-14.mp3
  say hauler "Thank you. Thank you." voice=pro-hauler-06.mp3
  say gravel "Take your time." voice=pro-gravel-15.mp3
  say hauler "A colonel. PALA. He pays in dollars. Cash." voice=pro-hauler-07.mp3
  say gravel "Where. When." voice=pro-gravel-16.mp3
  say hauler "Agrapol. The harbour. The twelfth of June. Rifles. Rockets, a lot of rockets. I knew it wasn't only boxes." voice=pro-hauler-08.mp3
  flag grill-done

beat grill-r when flag grill-renegade
  say gravel "Copy." voice=pro-gravel-17.mp3
  say hauler "No, no, wait, wait--" voice=pro-hauler-09.mp3
  say hauler "PALA! It's PALA, a colonel, he pays double for quiet flights, Agrapol, the harbour, the twelfth, rifles, rockets, that's all, that's all I swear!" voice=pro-hauler-10.mp3
  say widow "Gravel." voice=pro-widow-13.mp3
  say gravel "Done. Twenty seconds. He'll live." voice=pro-gravel-18.mp3
  say speedbump "...I'm watching the road." voice=pro-speedbump-11.mp3
  flag grill-done

beat intel when flag grill-done
  say gravel "Twelfth of June. Agrapol. That's all of it." voice=pro-gravel-19.mp3
  say widow "Agrapol's the Republic's fleet harbour." voice=pro-widow-14.mp3
  say ops "Report's filed, Mr. Ledger." voice=pro-ops-07.mp3
  say ledger "Ops. Days to the twelfth." voice=pro-ledger-14.mp3
  say ops "Thirty-eight." voice=pro-ops-08.mp3
  say ledger "Who do we have in Ignus?" voice=pro-ledger-15.mp3
  say ops "Four contacts. Two PALA. Two government." voice=pro-ops-09.mp3
  say ledger "Call all four." voice=pro-ledger-16.mp3
  say ledger "Ronin, pack up. We're going north." voice=pro-ledger-17.mp3
  start north
  reply north "LEDGER: we're going north, to Ignus." paragon="The government ones first. They should know." renegade="What's the rate?" paragon_voice=pro-ronin-11.mp3 renegade_voice=pro-ronin-12.mp3 timeout=15

beat north-p when flag north-paragon
  say ledger "Government first. Then the others. Same hour." voice=pro-ledger-18.mp3
  flag north-done

beat north-r when flag north-renegade
  say ledger "Double the Ministry's rate. Hazard on top. Same figure for all four." voice=pro-ledger-19.mp3
  flag north-done

beat ending-r when flag north-done if=renegade-4
  say ledger "You priced everything today, Ronin. I noticed." voice=pro-ledger-20.mp3

beat ending-p when flag north-done unless=renegade-4
  say ledger "You kept the crew breathing and the firm clean. I don't know yet what that costs." voice=pro-ledger-21.mp3

beat finale when flag north-done
  say speedbump "North. Okay. Heading three five zero. I'm just going to fly now." voice=pro-speedbump-12.mp3
  say sentry "Meridian, Sentry. Scope's clear. This conversation didn't happen." voice=pro-sentry-09.mp3
  remember tassara-job
  finish
  card "Prologue complete" "Meridian Freight & Aviation Services bills the Ministry by the hour. Losses will be itemised." seconds=8
  complete north

# Losing.
beat lost-team when done team_lost
  say ledger "Gravel's team is gone. I won't put a number on that. Not on this net." voice=pro-ledger-22.mp3

